[INFO] 09-21 20:00:12 run_experiments.py:122] **Pitfall Prediction**: 
[INFO] 09-21 20:00:12 run_experiments.py:122] - *Conceptual Trap*: Misunderstanding what "lowest terms" means - it means a and b are coprime (gcd(a,b)=1).
